desc:Temperance V5 [Arcana synth] (GFX Lab)
//tags: instrument synth physical model strings hammered dulcimer autoharp lfo vibrato tremolo chorus delay reverb arcana
//author: GardenFX
// by JGWizrad / Garden FX (GFX)
// Requires gfx-lab-drift, gfx-lab-output, gfx-lab-ui, gfx-lab-panel, gfx-lab-instrument, gfx-lab-voice, gfx-lab-power, gfx-lab-sliders, gfx-lab-v5-parts (.jsfx-inc) in the same folder.

slider70:psw_view=0<0,1,1{Panel only,Show all}>-Parameter sliders

